  "contentHtml": "\n<div><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/05102091.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062108im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s05102091.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--><br>Аборт нь чимээгүй алуурчин билээ. Харин охидууддаа залуучууддаа хандаж хэлэхэд жирэмслэсэн ч гэсэн хүүхдээ хэзээ ч авахуулж болохгүй шүү. Төрүүлээд хүүхэдтэй болохыг хүссэн хүнд өргүүлчих. Хэн нэгэн нь хүүхэдгүй шаналж байхад аборт хийлгэж хүүхдээ огт алж болохгүй. Амь нас болон өөрөө ахиж хүүхэдтэй болохгүй болох ч тохиолдол их байдаг.<br><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/41636032.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062108im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s41636032.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/05005554.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062108im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s05005554.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/57494918.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062108im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s57494918.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/05753642.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120314062108im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/s05753642.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/18/09515485.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"